          "path": "_m/9/q/j/r/zzyzx-california-spa-wk/zzyzx-pond-desert-studies-cent.jpg",
          "filename": "Zzyzx Pond - Desert Studies Center - Flickr - docentjoyce.jpg",
          "caption": "Desert Studies Center - Soda Springs Ca.\n\nThe California State University, Desert Studies Center is 8 miles south of Baker Ca. in the Mojave Desert. The Center is located on the shore of Soda Dry Lake in an area commonly known as Zzyzx - a name created by Evangelist Dr. Curtis H. Springer. In the 30s. Dr. Springer staked a claim on the land. He planted palms and developed ponds. For about 30 years he operated a religious-oriented health resort.",
          "alt": "Desert Studies Center - Soda Springs Ca.\n\nThe California State University, Desert Studies Center is 8 miles south of Baker Ca. in the Mojave Desert. The Center is located on the shore of Soda Dry Lake in an area commonly known as Zzyzx - a name created by Evangelist Dr. Curtis H. Springer. In the 30s. Dr. Springer staked a claim on the land. He planted palms and developed ponds. For about 30 years he operated a religious-oriented health resort.",
          "width": 2985,
          "height": 1924,
          "mimeType": "image/jpeg",
          "license": "CC BY 2.0",
          "artist": "Joyce Cory on Flickr as docentjoyce",
